message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "qsp-translate"
abstract: >-
  Local-first toolkit for importing, translating, reviewing and exporting QSP
  games, Twine stories, chapter-based text, and localization maps. Provides a
  browser UI and a CLI, with batch translation, pool statuses, and project data
  stored as files.
type: software
